Extension: NeuroPlusAgeAtResearch
Id: AgeAtResearch
Title: "Age at Research"
Description: "Patient age in whole years at the start of the study participation. Research datasets often shift or coarsen dates, so the age is recorded next to the date the data carries."
* ^url = "http://sphin-x.de/fhir/StructureDefinition/AgeAtResearch"
* insert ExtensionContext(ResearchSubject)
* value[x] only integer
